<para id="RM000000FTZ01FX" category="C" type-id="302NN" name-id="322KQ-01" from="200912">
<dtccode>P0712/38</dtccode>
<dtcname>Fluid Temperature Sensor Circuit (Low)</dtcname>
<dtccode>P0713/38</dtccode>
<dtcname>Fluid Temperature Sensor Circuit (High)</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000FTZ01FX_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000045900001">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The fluid temperature sensor installed in the valve body detects the fluid temperature in the transaxle hydraulic control circuit and inputs a signal corresponding to the fluid temperature to the engine control computer. If a malfunction occurs in the fluid temperature sensor, the engine control computer stops lock-up control as a fail-safe function.</ptxt>
